WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
A G1 robot stands beside a padded incline. An overhead safety tether connects it to a gantry; an operator holds the controller.

00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
The robot steps forward onto the padded surface while the operator and attached safety tether remain visible.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
The robot bends its torso and lowers a handheld tool toward the surface.

00:06.000 --> 00:07.000
The robot begins to raise its torso. This selected motion excerpt does not show the later trial outcome. Original speed, without sound.
